    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39557" root="نخرب" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْرَبُوتٌ</span></b>  [<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخْرَبُوتٌ</span>] An <i>excellent, nimble,</i> or
<i>agile,</i> she-camel. Some say that its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is augmentative, and its radical letters are <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خرب</span>; but
its derivation from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرَابٌ</span> is not apparent; therefore its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> should be considered as radical.
(AHei.)

